Stockfish
---------
Stockfish, GNU General Public License version 3. Stockfish is a separate program: chess-coach
starts it as a child process and talks to it over the UCI protocol, and never links any of its
code. When a release bundles a Stockfish binary, its licence text and a link to the exact
source it was built from ship beside it.
    https://github.com/official-stockfish/Stockfish

